MLDRE-40-24-DM,"LED Drivers with dimming capability can dim the LED light output over the full range from 100% to 0%. Our new electronic dimmable voltage LED drivers are class 2 rated and designed to operate with most standard MLV/Incandescent TRIAC (leading edge) dimmers by brands such as Lutron and Leviton, which are commonly used in home and commercial installations, and widely available. Encased in a low profile aluminum enclosure that includes 2 knock-outs to enable easy installation makes it the perfect choice for under cabinet lights, tape lights and various LED fixtures installations. Our electrical specification includes Auto Reset, over current and short circuit protection, and efficiency of 90% and higher allows the driver to operate at low temperatures. Offered in a variety of wattages in both 12V and 24V DC models."
MLDRE-96-24-DM,"LED Drivers with dimming capability can dim the LED light output over the full range from 100% to 0%. Our new electronic dimmable voltage LED drivers are class 2 rated and designed to operate with most standard MLV/Incandescent TRIAC (leading edge) dimmers by brands such as Lutron and Leviton, which are commonly used in home and commercial installations, and widely available. Encased in a low profile aluminum enclosure that includes 2 knock-outs to enable easy installation makes it the perfect choice for under cabinet lights, tape lights and various LED fixtures installations. Our electrical specification includes Auto Reset, over current and short circuit protection, and efficiency of 90% and higher allows the driver to operate at low temperatures. Offered in a variety of wattages in both 12V and 24V DC models."
MLDR-120-24,"A LED driver is an electrical device that regulates the power to an LED or string(s) of LEDs. What makes a driver different from conventional power supplies is that an LED driver responds to the ever-changing needs of the LED, or circuit of LEDs, by supplying a constant amount of power to the LED as its electrical properties change with temperature. Non-Dimmable Drivers provide steady 12V or 24V current along with high efficiency. All our LED drivers are energy-efficient, eco-friendly, safe, and produce very little heat. We offer a wide variety of hard-wired and portable drivers for wall or ceiling, in attic or under counters, but also compact enough for areas with limited space. Available in both indoor and outdoor designs."
MLDR-20-24JB,"A LED driver is an electrical device that regulates the power to an LED or string(s) of LEDs. What makes a driver different from conventional power supplies is that an LED driver responds to the ever-changing needs of the LED, or circuit of LEDs, by supplying a constant amount of power to the LED as its electrical properties change with temperature. Non-Dimmable Drivers provide steady 12V or 24V current along with high efficiency. All our LED drivers are energy-efficient, eco-friendly, safe, and produce very little heat. We offer a wide variety of hard-wired and portable drivers for wall or ceiling, in attic or under counters, but also compact enough for areas with limited space. Available in both indoor and outdoor designs."
PGID2448,"Available in 48W and 96W, these plug-in drivers support a wide voltage range from 100V AC to 240V AC, making them versatile for 24V lighting systems. With a high power factor of 0.9, they are designed for energy efficiency and reduced power loss. The drivers feature overcurrent and overvoltage protection to enhance safety and reliability."
PGID2496,"Available in 48W and 96W, these plug-in drivers support a wide voltage range from 100V AC to 240V AC, making them versatile for 24V lighting systems. With a high power factor of 0.9, they are designed for energy efficiency and reduced power loss. The drivers feature overcurrent and overvoltage protection to enhance safety and reliability."
DR-96-24-TM-5N1D,"Magic Lite introduces the Infini Drive 24V LED Driver, a next-generation dimmable constant voltage driver engineered for performance, reliability, and versatility. With 5-in-1 dimming compatibility, a no minimum load requirement, and a 5-year warranty, this driver is built to handle demanding residential and commercial installations with ease."
DD-2460-S-WH,"At Magic Lite, innovation meets simplicity. The DimDrive is a breakthrough constant voltage LED driver that combines power supply, dimming, and on/off control in one compact device. Designed to fit neatly inside a standard single-gang or multi-gang electrical switch box, DimDrive saves time, reduces clutter, and delivers smooth flicker-free lighting performance."
DD-24100-S-WH,"At Magic Lite, innovation meets simplicity. The DimDrive is a breakthrough constant voltage LED driver that combines power supply, dimming, and on/off control in one compact device. Designed to fit neatly inside a standard single-gang or multi-gang electrical switch box, DimDrive saves time, reduces clutter, and delivers smooth flicker-free lighting performance."
CNTRL-4Z-CCT-RWP-BK,"The Rotating CCT Scene Remote is a compact, efficient solution for managing brightness and colour temperature with precision. Utilizing 2.4GHz wireless technology, it provides seamless control with a range of up to 30 metres. Its rotating dial allows for precise adjustments, and its magnetic mounting ensures secure and hassle-free installation. Available in black or white, the remote integrates smoothly into any lighting setup."
CNTRL-4Z-CCT-RWP-WH,"The Rotating CCT Scene Remote is a compact, efficient solution for managing brightness and colour temperature with precision. Utilizing 2.4GHz wireless technology, it provides seamless control with a range of up to 30 metres. Its rotating dial allows for precise adjustments, and its magnetic mounting ensures secure and hassle-free installation. Available in black or white, the remote integrates smoothly into any lighting setup."
