CNTRL-2W-CCT,"The 2-Wire CCT Controller (2.4GHz) is designed to deliver seamless control over colour temperature and brightness for LED lighting systems. Leveraging 2.4GHz RF wireless technology, this controller provides reliable, long-range communication and advanced functionality for both residential and commercial lighting projects."
